cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  An empirical benchmark of Vision Transformers for cervical-vertebra
  landmark localisation
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below. Note that the
  dataset is not distributed with this software and carries its own licence and
  citation requirements; see docs/dataset.md.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Monteiro Pereira
